**File:** `src/tools/discover/index.test.ts`

Add test cases:
- Deep scan (with path) includes ancestor chain before subtree when ancestors exist.
- Deep scan with no ancestors above target omits ancestor chain section.
- Shallow scan (no path) does not include ancestor chain.

**7c. Update validate tool tests**

**File:** `src/tools/validate/index.test.ts`

Add test case:
- Detects missing `description` field and returns `missing-description` warning.
- Does not warn when `description` is present.

**Why:** Playbook convention: tests are co-located (`index.test.ts` next to
`index.ts`), use Vitest with explicit imports, use factory functions and temp dirs
